Objectives:

* Declare and iterate through an array of 16-bit unsigned integers to compute their cumulative sum using Embedded C on an 8051 microcontroller.
* Split the resulting total sum into lower, middle, and upper 8-bit bytes using bitwise right-shift (`>>`) and masking (`&`) operations.
* Verify the computed sum across parallel ports `P0`, `P1`, and `P2` using the Keil $\mu$Vision debugger peripheral windows.
